WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
(playful music)

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.658
- I hate touching.

00:00:07.658 --> 00:00:08.712
- Makes me anxious.

00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:09.780
- I don't like touching people

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.359
and I don't like touching things.

00:00:11.359 --> 00:00:12.437
- Ever since I was little, I hated it.

00:00:12.437 --> 00:00:16.259
- I've learned to pretend like
I don't know what a hug is.

00:00:16.259 --> 00:00:19.217
- If you stay out of arms
reach, they can't get ya.

00:00:19.217 --> 00:00:21.752
- I see somebody I know,
and I'll smile from afar,

00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:22.729
and then hide.

00:00:22.729 --> 00:00:24.557
- It'd be nice if I could come out of this

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:29.328
and be less anxious about
having to touch other people.

00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:31.974
- This is a problem of mine,
I should probably fix it.

00:00:31.974 --> 00:00:34.892
- I'm sure that'll change once
I continue to go to therapy,

00:00:34.892 --> 00:00:39.421
but as of right now, I
just like to be alone.

00:00:39.421 --> 00:00:41.202
Some people just don't
like each other's smells.

00:00:41.202 --> 00:00:42.842
If people thought I needed a hug,

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.111
people gave me a really good hug.

00:00:44.111 --> 00:00:46.624
- Every person was so excited to hug.

00:00:46.624 --> 00:00:47.844
I think people like hugs.

00:00:47.844 --> 00:00:49.356
- [Woman] And they told
me I was a good hugger.

00:00:49.356 --> 00:00:50.806
- It was nice to see sort of an outpouring

00:00:50.806 --> 00:00:53.645
of support of people being
like, oh yeah, I'll hug you.

00:00:53.645 --> 00:00:54.618
- [Brunette] It was just horrible,

00:00:54.618 --> 00:00:55.599
it's just too much.

00:00:55.599 --> 00:00:56.992
- [Man] I hugged my best friend,

00:00:56.992 --> 00:00:58.480
who I've known for 12 years.

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.814
- [Woman In Striped Shirt] That was sweet.

00:01:00.814 --> 00:01:02.897
- [Man] Right foot, blue.

00:01:04.046 --> 00:01:05.128
Now we're twistin'.

00:01:05.128 --> 00:01:07.514
- [Woman In Striped Shirt]
This is my nightmare.

00:01:07.514 --> 00:01:08.375
- [Woman] Oh, God.

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:09.734
- People love this game.

00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:11.595
- [Woman] Oh, God, I'm getting dizzy.

00:01:11.595 --> 00:01:13.379
I'm so uncomfortable.

00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:14.397
- Got pretty lucky.

00:01:14.397 --> 00:01:16.769
- I just don't wanna do it.

00:01:16.769 --> 00:01:19.519
I am one spin away from quitting.

00:01:20.779 --> 00:01:23.072
(laughing)

00:01:23.072 --> 00:01:23.905
- [Brunette] This is like yoga.

00:01:23.905 --> 00:01:24.738
- [Woman] Yeah.

00:01:24.738 --> 00:01:25.571
- Yeah this is good stuff.

00:01:25.571 --> 00:01:28.738
- No, that's it, that's it, that's it.

00:01:31.292 --> 00:01:32.719
- I thought I was making great progress.

00:01:32.719 --> 00:01:35.789
- I would like to not hate it so much.

00:01:35.789 --> 00:01:37.789
- I wanted to quit from the beginning.

00:01:37.789 --> 00:01:39.989
- If I were to practice my
social skills a little better,

00:01:39.989 --> 00:01:41.992
I'd be a lot more willing to hug more.

00:01:41.992 --> 00:01:44.809
- I hope after this,
I'm a huggy kind of guy.

00:01:44.809 --> 00:01:46.697
- Maybe one day.

00:01:46.697 --> 00:01:49.280
(upbeat music)

